WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.544 --> 00:00:04.147
Wearing a gold robe over his clothing, Tom sat on the throne in the cathedral.

2
00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:08.051
He grew more miserable with every minute of the coronation ceremony.

3
00:00:08.071 --> 00:00:31.970
At last the great moment The archbishop lifted the crown and held it over Tom's head.

4
00:00:33.852 --> 00:00:38.194
Everyone was so busy watching the ceremony that no one noticed a boy in rags.

5
00:00:41.317 --> 00:00:44.859
He stepped from behind an old tomb and walked up the aisle.

6
00:00:44.879 --> 00:00:48.521
"Stop!" Edward shouted.

7
00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:51.263
"I forbid you to crown him!

8
00:00:52.704 --> 00:00:53.745
I am the king!"

9
00:00:55.386 --> 00:00:57.928
Tom stood up as a guard grabbed Edward's arm.

10
00:00:59.356 --> 00:01:00.236
"Let go of him!"

11
00:01:00.656 --> 00:01:01.517
Tom commanded.

12
00:01:01.537 --> 00:01:03.697
"He's telling the truth!

13
00:01:04.717 --> 00:01:06.078
He is the king!"

14
00:01:09.219 --> 00:01:13.140
Lord Hertford was as startled as everyone else but quickly recovered.

15
00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:16.901
"Unfortunately, His Majesty is ill again.

16
00:01:17.821 --> 00:01:20.702
Pay no attention to him and throw that pauper out."

17
00:01:20.722 --> 00:01:24.923
"Touch him again, and you'll be thrown out!"

18
00:01:25.363 --> 00:01:26.503
Tom said to the guard.

19
00:01:27.624 --> 00:01:31.045
The guard let go of Edward, who continued walking up the aisle.

20
00:01:32.706 --> 00:01:35.708
As Edward reached the throne, Tom fell on his knees.

21
00:01:35.729 --> 00:01:41.152
"Let Tom Canty be the first to swear allegiance to you, my king."

22
00:01:42.793 --> 00:01:45.115
Lord Hertford could not contain his surprise.

23
00:01:45.135 --> 00:01:48.397
"You two look exactly alike!

24
00:01:49.878 --> 00:01:55.642
If you don't mind, sir," he said to Edward, "I'd like to ask you some questions."

25
00:01:55.662 --> 00:01:59.417
"Certainly," Edward replied.

26
00:02:00.618 --> 00:02:06.143
Lord Hertford quizzed Edward about the court, the palace, King Henry, and Princess Elizabeth.

27
00:02:07.965 --> 00:02:10.227
Edward was able to answer everything correctly.

28
00:02:10.247 --> 00:02:14.551
"Impressive!" Lord Hertford said.

29
00:02:14.571 --> 00:02:18.835
"But someone could have helped you learn the right answers."

30
00:02:20.897 --> 00:02:23.759
Tom remembered how Marlow had helped him do just that.

31
00:02:25.992 --> 00:02:29.813
"I'm not convinced that you're Edward," Lord Hertford said.

32
00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:33.894
"If only there was another way to test you Wait!

33
00:02:34.294 --> 00:02:34.834
I've got it!

34
00:02:36.175 --> 00:02:37.615
Where is the Great Seal?

35
00:02:38.776 --> 00:02:41.016
Only the real King Edward knows this."

36
00:02:41.036 --> 00:02:46.498
"I have no idea where it is," Tom said, trying to be helpful.

37
00:02:46.518 --> 00:02:49.078
"Oh, that's easy!

38
00:02:49.859 --> 00:02:51.299
Where's my whipping boy?"

39
00:02:52.499 --> 00:02:59.384
Edward looked around until he spotted Marlow.

40
00:02:59.404 --> 00:03:01.005
"Take a carriage to the palace.

41
00:03:02.086 --> 00:03:05.328
You'll find the seal in a hidden compartment in my room.

42
00:03:06.469 --> 00:03:08.830
A servant will open the compartment for you."

43
00:03:10.271 --> 00:03:14.034
Marlow hesitated to obey this boy who was dressed worse than he was.

44
00:03:14.054 --> 00:03:16.396
"What are you waiting for?"

45
00:03:16.816 --> 00:03:17.456
Tom said.

46
00:03:17.476 --> 00:03:20.018
"You heard King Edward."

47
00:03:21.299 --> 00:03:22.580
Marlow ran down the aisle.

48
00:03:24.921 --> 00:03:28.484
The cathedral buzzed with chatter as everyone waited for Marlow's return.

49
00:03:30.116 --> 00:03:34.017
"I think the pauper is the real king," one man said to another.

50
00:03:34.037 --> 00:03:36.638
"He picked Marlow out of the crowd."

51
00:03:36.658 --> 00:03:43.900
"Yes, but he didn't know that Marlow is no longer a whipping boy," the second man said.

52
00:03:45.961 --> 00:03:49.022
At last Marlow returned—with empty hands.

53
00:03:50.242 --> 00:03:51.502
Lord Hertford shook his head.

54
00:03:51.522 --> 00:03:57.224
"I don't understand how anyone could lose something as big as the Great Seal.

55
00:03:58.408 --> 00:04:02.330
It's a heavy disk, made of gold—" "Wait!"

56
00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:03.550
Tom shouted.

57
00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:06.632
"Are you talking about a round thing with lettering on it?"

58
00:04:07.872 --> 00:04:09.933
Both Lord Hertford and Edward nodded.

59
00:04:09.953 --> 00:04:15.776
"If only you'd described it like that, you could have had it awhile ago," Tom said to Lord

60
00:04:15.816 --> 00:04:18.957
Hertford. Then he turned to Edward.

61
00:04:18.977 --> 00:04:22.619
"The day we met, you hid it before you left.

62
00:04:23.679 --> 00:04:25.420
Tell everyone here where you put it."

63
00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:31.382
Edward thought and thought while Tom grew increasingly nervous.

64
00:04:31.402 --> 00:04:38.707
"Remember," Tom said, "we talked about our families and what I did with my friends.

65
00:04:39.908 --> 00:04:42.110
We traded clothes and looked in the mirror."

66
00:04:43.571 --> 00:04:46.112
With every hint, Edward nodded in agreement.

67
00:04:46.132 --> 00:04:51.256
"And then you noticed that the guard had injured my hand."

68
00:04:53.017 --> 00:04:53.957
Tom held it up.

69
00:04:55.018 --> 00:04:57.500
"Look, you can still see a faint bruise.

70
00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:04.222
You wanted to scold the guard, but first—" "Oh, now I remember!"

71
00:05:04.662 --> 00:05:05.382
Edward cried.

72
00:05:05.402 --> 00:05:10.743
"Marlow, go to my room and look inside an armored glove on the table."

73
00:05:10.763 --> 00:05:14.765
"Yes!" Tom hugged Edward.

74
00:05:14.785 --> 00:05:16.365
"That's it."

75
00:05:19.566 --> 00:05:22.647
When Marlow returned with the Great Seal, Tom grinned.

76
00:05:22.667 --> 00:05:27.068
"And now, my king, it's time for you to be crowned."

77
00:05:29.276 --> 00:05:30.918
Everyone in the cathedral applauded.

78
00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:37.623
Lord Hertford waited for the noise to die down before addressing Tom.

79
00:05:37.643 --> 00:05:44.429
"And you—whoever you are—will be sent to prison for impersonating the king!"

80
00:05:44.449 --> 00:05:47.231
"No!" Edward cried.

81
00:05:47.251 --> 00:05:50.033
"I owe my crown to Tom.

82
00:05:51.134 --> 00:05:53.436
He could have said nothing and continued as king.

83
00:05:54.697 --> 00:05:57.520
Instead he helped me remember where the Great Seal was.

84
00:05:58.684 --> 00:06:00.045
Sit down, Lord Hertford."

85
00:06:03.048 --> 00:06:04.809
Lord Hertford sank into a seat.

86
00:06:04.829 --> 00:06:09.313
"And one more thing," Edward said to everyone.

87
00:06:09.333 --> 00:06:13.637
"I've heard wonderful reports of Tom's brief reign.

88
00:06:14.878 --> 00:06:18.381
I can only hope to be as good a king as he has been."

89
00:06:20.522 --> 00:06:24.005
Tom removed the gold robe and placed it over Edward's shoulders.

90
00:06:24.025 --> 00:06:30.278
"By the way," Edward whispered, "how did you know where the Great Seal was?"

91
00:06:31.419 --> 00:06:33.241
Tom turned red and confessed.

92
00:06:33.261 --> 00:06:38.186
"I was using it to crack nuts!"

93
00:06:40.388 --> 00:06:42.610
The boys laughed together.

94
00:06:44.231 --> 00:06:48.696
Then the coronation ceremony resumed, and Edward was crowned king.
